		{
			"id":"47e910259f0115f4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Info\n\nThe Shelter is an [[Outer Room.canvas|Outer Room]].\nThe Shelter has a note about trying to hide three to four people from the Red Guard.\n\nIt has a terminal that allows you to unlock the Time-locked Safe\n- The starting date is November 6 (You can discover the starting date by using the [[027 - Library.canvas|027 - Library]] or the [[030 - Drafting Studio.canvas|030 - Drafting Studio]]. \n\t- As in Day 0 = November 6\n\nThe terminal has access to a Radiation Monitor too:\n- If the radiation surpasses a certain level, all doors in the mansion will be unlocked.\n- Supposedly when you do or trigger experiments on the [[036 - Laboratory.canvas|036 - Laboratory]], it increases the radiation level within the week.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-580,
			"y":-1100,
			"width":880,
			"height":460
		}
